<main class="pc" data-product-contact="2"><p class="pc-kicker">CRANIO SYSTEMS / Contact</p><h1>Kontaktieren Sie uns.</h1><p class="pc-lead">Termine, Ausbildung, Kooperation und allgemeine Anfragen.</p><section class="pc-section"><div class="pc-contact"><div class="pc-card"><p class="pc-kicker">CRANIO SYSTEMS</p><h2>ROOT FRONTIER SYSTEMS</h2><a class="pc-link" href="mailto:rootfrontier.office@gmail.com">rootfrontier.office@gmail.com</a><div class="pc-actions"><a class="pc-button" href="../your-cranium/">Personal Navigator</a></div></div><div class="pc-card"><form data-contact-product action="https://formsubmit.co/rootfrontier.office@gmail.com" method="POST"><input type="hidden" name="_subject" value="CRANIO SYSTEMS — website enquiry"><label for="contact-name">Name</label><input id="contact-name" name="name" autocomplete="name" maxlength="120" required><label for="contact-email">Ihre E-Mail</label><input id="contact-email" name="email" type="email" autocomplete="email" maxlength="254" required><label for="contact-topic">Thema</label><select id="contact-topic" name="topic"><option>Termin</option><option>Ausbildung</option><option>Technologie und Kooperation</option><option>Andere Anfrage</option></select><label for="contact-message">Nachricht</label><textarea id="contact-message" name="message" maxlength="3000" required></textarea><p class="pc-note">FormSubmit → rootfrontier.office@gmail.com. Bitte keine Diagnosen, medizinischen Unterlagen oder vertraulichen Angaben senden.</p><div class="pc-actions"><button type="submit">Senden</button><button class="contact-fallback" type="button" data-contact-draft hidden>E-Mail-Entwurf öffnen</button></div><p role="status" aria-live="polite"></p><script type="application/json" data-contact-strings>["Wird gesendet…","Der Dienst hat die Anfrage angenommen. Eine Antwort erfolgt per E-Mail.","Zustellung nicht bestätigt. Ihre Eingaben bleiben erhalten. Öffnen und senden Sie bei Bedarf einen E-Mail-Entwurf."]</script></form></div></div></section></main>